endmethod
-- End of method definition for .scopeSet(DBREF)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Method:      .roleSet()
--
-- Description: set the current ROLE in the Admin element form
-- value.
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- method Type:   method/Procedure
